/v/t64.5771-25/499617850_1487319006264929_6933773215135330244_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=CFNwBupsZygQ7kNvwENR11t&_nc_oc=AdqUSmVqINGO2G3mXTnU2TuBZNxNqq6HRbNxqb92ZDOSzD6tch4OI5-5RWgA3iQYbWI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQGo44k3OLg6POg6xE6YU7OmkVJAGF1rjYnlV22-ykfZA&oe=6AF89EC4"}, {"file_name": "Screenshot 2026-05-01 183526.png", "id": "1935829020397877", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823878_1935829023731210_4138014282540294142_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=O4Ymhyi3CZMQ7kNvwEvP6Fe&_nc_oc=AdqCWGr6bMvrvyFYWhf92ASWyWz3xtl5uH0jSF_9a31U-1RoK8uMEinA1UY1JV19ssg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRalmKT0e_S1KIfR-XDeWbx_20LccJTxYtIy09CMODivw&oe=6AF8ACC3"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Air Distribution Systems", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Air Distribution Systems is an immersive VR training application developed by ImmerseLearn to enhance practical learning in HVAC air distribution. Designed as part of the Air Distribution Systems micro-credential program, this application enables learners to engage in realistic, scenario-based training that builds critical skills in system components, airflow management, and installation practices.\n\nThrough interactive simulations, users can explore key concepts, practice procedures, and gain confidence in a safe, controlled environment that mirrors real-world HVAC tasks. The experience is structured to reinforce theoretical knowledge through hands-on application, improving retention and job readiness.\n\nPlease note: This application is exclusively accessible to individuals enrolled in the ImmerseLearn Air Distribution Systems micro-credential program. Access is restricted and intended solely for registered learners as part of their training journey.", "short_description": "Air Distribution Systems is a VR training application from ImmerseLearn, de